WEBVTT

00:00:09.005 --> 00:00:10.273
[All characters, locations,
and events in this drama]

00:00:10.273 --> 00:00:11.649
[are fictional and not based
on real people or events.]

00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:13.121
[Production guidelines were followed
when filming children and animals.]

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:28.272
What? Just a kid?

00:00:28.272 --> 00:00:31.105
Let go, let go, you murderer!

00:00:36.772 --> 00:00:39.972
So you're a Zhen bird merchant's son.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.105
You weren't anywhere to be found,

00:00:42.105 --> 00:00:43.972
but why now of all times?

00:00:45.538 --> 00:00:47.872
I wish you had shown up two months late.

00:00:52.572 --> 00:00:55.105
- Servant.
- Yes.

00:00:55.105 --> 00:00:56.738
Got you.

00:00:57.905 --> 00:01:00.705
Open this now! Open the door! Let me out!

00:01:00.705 --> 00:01:02.238
Prepare my official robes immediately.

00:01:02.238 --> 00:01:03.272
Pardon?

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:06.138
[Paru: The bell signaling the curfew lift]
It'll be a while before the Paru rings.

00:01:08.838 --> 00:01:12.105
Since we've already slept for the night,
we'll go to the palace once the Paru rings.

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.672
But what's the urgency?

00:01:14.672 --> 00:01:18.072
It seems like the Zhen bird is
still in the hands of the Left Minister.

00:01:51.338 --> 00:01:53.105
Don't fall apart.

00:02:06.272 --> 00:02:08.905
Go away.

00:02:12.738 --> 00:02:14.472
The bee's gone.

00:02:17.072 --> 00:02:18.705
It's gone.

00:02:31.205 --> 00:02:32.905
Am I out of my mind?

00:02:32.905 --> 00:02:34.772
Am I insane?

00:03:35.405 --> 00:03:39.238
[Episode 6 Shared Fate, Lee Gang is Dal I]

00:03:40.805 --> 00:03:42.638
Young Lady, no...

00:03:42.638 --> 00:03:45.705
Lady Bissi, don't you sleep?

00:03:45.705 --> 00:03:48.972
Why are you walking around here every dawn?

00:04:10.872 --> 00:04:14.172
Congratulations on becoming Lady Bissi...

00:04:21.438 --> 00:04:24.105
Even now, you're trembling like this.

00:04:33.138 --> 00:04:36.038
You'll soon undergo royal marriage.

00:04:36.038 --> 00:04:37.772
Leave the past behind

00:04:37.772 --> 00:04:39.238
and live with His Highness in peace.

00:04:39.238 --> 00:04:43.705
Without a royal wedding,
even if I spend decades as a Bissi,

00:04:43.705 --> 00:04:45.472
I won't be the Crown Prince's woman.

00:04:45.472 --> 00:04:47.172
What nonsense...

00:04:48.038 --> 00:04:51.805
Then why did you enter the palace?

00:04:51.805 --> 00:04:54.672
By refusing to enter the palace
using that gun as leverage,

00:04:54.672 --> 00:04:59.072
are you abandoning Prince Je Woon?

00:04:59.072 --> 00:05:01.605
There was no other choice.

00:05:02.972 --> 00:05:05.805
Will you blame me again?

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:08.738
Let me break your delusion.

00:05:10.505 --> 00:05:12.805
You never loved me.

00:05:15.772 --> 00:05:17.872
Then what was I doing?

00:05:18.705 --> 00:05:21.345
What were those long years

00:05:21.345 --> 00:05:23.272
we spent together?

00:05:23.272 --> 00:05:25.338
Sympathy, longing.

00:05:25.338 --> 00:05:28.972
A foolish mistake calling that love.

00:05:28.972 --> 00:05:31.638
If that's what you call love,

00:05:33.238 --> 00:05:35.872
doesn't real love deserve better?

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:42.705
Now, if you're not going to be
swayed by me, what about this?

00:05:42.705 --> 00:05:46.505
The Crown Prince made that porter a eunuch.

00:05:48.638 --> 00:05:51.038
How can a woman become a eunuch?

00:05:51.038 --> 00:05:52.038
Where is she?

00:05:52.038 --> 00:05:54.072
Where's Dal I now?

00:05:54.072 --> 00:05:57.205
With that expression, worrying so much about her,

00:05:57.205 --> 00:05:59.438
that's why I've made my decision.

00:06:00.905 --> 00:06:04.905
Whether the Crown Prince
gets hurt, or her, or both,

00:06:04.905 --> 00:06:06.738
all of this

00:06:08.105 --> 00:06:10.172
is because of you, my prince.

00:06:18.405 --> 00:06:22.805
Your Highness, if you delay any longer,
you'll be late for the morning council.

00:06:22.805 --> 00:06:25.138
I'll enter now.

00:06:25.972 --> 00:06:28.072
Lady Bissi.

00:06:28.072 --> 00:06:30.705
- Tell His Highness that I have come.
- Do not tell him.

00:06:30.705 --> 00:06:32.638
Prince Je Woon.

00:06:33.305 --> 00:06:36.205
- Tell His Highness.
- I said don't.

00:06:36.872 --> 00:06:41.805
How can an unwed Bissi enter
Donggung Palace without any notice?

00:06:41.805 --> 00:06:44.577
I've already broken the rules.

00:06:44.577 --> 00:06:47.105
Why not break them all the way?

00:07:08.905 --> 00:07:11.605
Ah, it's so noisy.

00:07:19.405 --> 00:07:21.172
What? What is it?

00:07:29.238 --> 00:07:30.272
No.

00:07:30.272 --> 00:07:32.872
Well, no... that's not it.

00:07:32.872 --> 00:07:35.538
Escort Bissi out.

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:38.138
- Wait...
- Let's go, Lady Bissi.

00:07:38.138 --> 00:07:42.172
Oh my, what's going on?

00:07:44.505 --> 00:07:46.638
Everyone, step back.

00:07:46.638 --> 00:07:50.305
If anyone dares to speak of what happened today,
you will be punished, understood?

00:07:50.305 --> 00:07:51.305
- Understood.
- Yes.

00:07:51.305 --> 00:07:53.205
Let's go.

00:07:53.205 --> 00:07:54.838
Go quickly.

00:07:57.838 --> 00:07:59.072
Hey! Why are you here?

00:07:59.072 --> 00:08:00.472
What'd you do to me?

00:08:00.472 --> 00:08:02.072
I didn't do anything!

00:08:02.072 --> 00:08:03.472
If I really had done something to you,
at least I wouldn't feel so wronged!

00:08:03.472 --> 00:08:04.838
Hey, and!

00:08:04.838 --> 00:08:07.005
- Oh, my.
- Is this my body right now?

00:08:10.905 --> 00:08:16.538
Is this the time for sweet talks
like 'you are me, and I am you'?

00:08:16.538 --> 00:08:19.905
Chief Court Lady's niece saw it,
and Lady Bissi also saw it.

00:08:19.905 --> 00:08:22.205
To others, this looks like...

00:08:22.205 --> 00:08:26.172
Like sodomy, Your Highness.

00:08:42.172 --> 00:08:43.873
Please,

00:08:43.873 --> 00:08:46.438
don't do anything.

00:08:55.138 --> 00:08:58.805
It's like throwing ash on a perfectly made dish.

00:08:58.805 --> 00:09:01.538
Of all people, Bissi had to see that.

00:09:01.538 --> 00:09:03.305
What shall we do?

00:09:03.305 --> 00:09:06.438
Won't Park Dal I be in danger?

00:09:06.438 --> 00:09:11.305
After fifty years in the palace, I've realized

00:09:14.038 --> 00:09:16.605
it's more important to avoid danger

00:09:16.605 --> 00:09:19.872
than to chase after opportunities.

00:09:21.138 --> 00:09:25.105
Unless the Crown Prince himself
takes her in as a concubine,

00:09:25.105 --> 00:09:28.672
it's best to stay quiet for now.

00:09:28.672 --> 00:09:32.105
You truly are wise.

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:35.538
Come to your realization as you pat my back.

00:09:35.538 --> 00:09:37.172
Ah, yes.

00:09:41.038 --> 00:09:46.005
Even though Lady Bissi knows I'm a woman...

00:09:46.005 --> 00:09:48.138
That's why I'm even more uneasy.

00:09:48.138 --> 00:09:52.072
What can't a woman who shot
the Crown Prince in the heart do?

00:09:53.705 --> 00:09:56.638
What do you mean by that? A gun?

00:09:56.638 --> 00:09:59.505
Was it Lady Bissi who put that hole
in Your Highness' chest?

00:09:59.505 --> 00:10:01.472
Didn't I tell you?

00:10:04.172 --> 00:10:09.072
But you've both resolved things
peacefully now, right?

00:10:09.072 --> 00:10:14.072
There's no way she'll ever raise a gun again
and put a hole in this chest, right?

00:10:14.072 --> 00:10:16.838
Maybe. Be careful.

00:10:16.838 --> 00:10:18.838
It's your body now.

00:10:23.305 --> 00:10:27.105
Mother, Father. I'll be leaving first.

00:10:27.105 --> 00:10:28.769
Your unfilial daughter

00:10:28.769 --> 00:10:30.705
will go ahead.

00:10:34.372 --> 00:10:35.538
Your Highness.

00:10:35.538 --> 00:10:38.872
What's kept you so lost in thought since earlier?

00:10:38.872 --> 00:10:41.172
With less than fifty days
before the royal wedding,

00:10:41.172 --> 00:10:43.505
are you thinking of something else?

00:10:43.505 --> 00:10:46.538
You're not planning to do anything, right?

00:10:46.538 --> 00:10:48.438
Don't worry.

00:10:48.438 --> 00:10:51.438
It won't be me, but the Chief Court Lady's
niece will take action.

00:10:51.438 --> 00:10:54.672
The Chief Court Lady's niece?

00:10:54.672 --> 00:10:58.805
If she's the niece of the Chief Court Lady,
doesn't she work for the Grand Queen Dowager?

00:10:58.805 --> 00:11:03.438
Then why would she be the one spreading
harmful rumors about His Highness?

00:11:03.438 --> 00:11:05.072
Because she must be

00:11:05.072 --> 00:11:06.205
[Court lady of Donggung Palace, Jo Mi Geum]

00:11:06.205 --> 00:11:07.605
just as foolish as I am.

00:11:07.605 --> 00:11:10.238
- Right.
- I already ate three, you know?

00:11:11.838 --> 00:11:13.238
Have you heard the news?

00:11:13.238 --> 00:11:15.572
What news?

00:11:17.438 --> 00:11:20.405
You have to keep this absolutely secret.

00:11:21.638 --> 00:11:23.738
I heard that last night...

00:11:23.738 --> 00:11:27.738
The new eunuch of Donggung Palace

00:11:28.672 --> 00:11:29.805
slept with the Crown Prince.

00:11:29.805 --> 00:11:32.105
- What? That's insane!
- Yeah.

00:11:32.105 --> 00:11:34.038
Then why bother reading romance novels?

00:11:34.038 --> 00:11:35.305
Real life's more dramatic than this.

00:11:35.305 --> 00:11:37.072
Exactly.

00:11:39.438 --> 00:11:40.772
They're boring now.

00:11:40.772 --> 00:11:42.272
Reality's more entertaining.

00:11:42.272 --> 00:11:44.038
Oh, seriously.

00:11:45.005 --> 00:11:46.205
Your Highness.

00:11:46.205 --> 00:11:48.105
There's a message from the mansion.

00:11:48.105 --> 00:11:50.605
Prince Je Woon has...

00:11:50.605 --> 00:11:52.538
What's with Prince Je Woon?

00:12:17.338 --> 00:12:19.905
What is this nonsense?

00:12:21.538 --> 00:12:24.038
I'm taking everything back.

00:12:24.038 --> 00:12:28.738
The warmth, peace, and pure love I gave you.

00:12:28.738 --> 00:12:30.638
Why are you doing this so suddenly?

00:12:30.638 --> 00:12:34.772
I clearly asked you to do nothing,

00:12:36.272 --> 00:12:39.638
yet you still spread rumors
about His Highness and Dal I?

00:12:43.772 --> 00:12:45.372
Why are you laughing?

00:12:45.372 --> 00:12:46.738
Is there something on my face?

00:12:46.738 --> 00:12:47.969
No,

00:12:47.969 --> 00:12:49.872
nothing on your face.

00:12:52.505 --> 00:12:56.172
Actually, there's some rice on your lip.

00:12:59.072 --> 00:13:00.738
Didn't you know?

00:13:00.738 --> 00:13:04.072
You said there's nothing on my face, right?

00:13:04.072 --> 00:13:06.072
If you said it's not there, then it's not.

00:13:06.072 --> 00:13:10.538
If it's there, then it's there from now on.

00:13:18.505 --> 00:13:20.105
You still don't know me!

00:13:20.105 --> 00:13:23.738
Even if you bring down His Highness,
do you think I'll take the throne?

00:13:25.005 --> 00:13:26.738
Exactly.

00:13:26.738 --> 00:13:28.605
I don't know anymore.

00:13:28.605 --> 00:13:30.838
Yes, you do know.

00:13:30.838 --> 00:13:34.405
You know what I want, what my desperation is.

00:13:34.405 --> 00:13:37.045
It wasn't me, but you,

00:13:37.045 --> 00:13:39.572
who never truly loved.

00:13:40.572 --> 00:13:41.972
What kind of man

00:13:41.972 --> 00:13:45.705
would desperately want the woman he loves

00:13:45.705 --> 00:13:47.972
to become someone else's?

00:13:50.138 --> 00:13:52.038
Fine.

00:13:52.038 --> 00:13:54.472
It was just youthful stubbornness.

00:13:54.472 --> 00:13:56.481
Let's each go our separate ways now.

00:13:57.472 --> 00:13:58.753
Alright.

00:13:59.738 --> 00:14:02.405
I'll do as you wish, Prince.

00:14:02.405 --> 00:14:04.305
I'll become the Crown Princess.

00:14:04.305 --> 00:14:05.438
Then the Queen.

00:14:05.438 --> 00:14:08.638
Someday I'll even take
the Grand Queen Dowager's palace.

00:14:08.638 --> 00:14:12.272
I'll go through all those steps properly.

00:14:13.105 --> 00:14:17.572
But I might speed up the process.

00:14:17.572 --> 00:14:19.905
When both the King and the Crown Prince are dead,

00:14:19.905 --> 00:14:22.005
the throne will naturally go to you.

00:14:22.005 --> 00:14:26.172
- You...
- Every morning paying respects as King and Queen,

00:14:26.172 --> 00:14:28.505
we'll face each other that way.

00:14:29.672 --> 00:14:32.272
As we promised long ago,

00:14:32.272 --> 00:14:37.272
we'll grow old together
with gray hair and wrinkled faces.

00:14:40.505 --> 00:14:42.689
That's all I need.

00:14:51.072 --> 00:14:55.072
Let's never see each other again.

00:14:55.072 --> 00:14:56.738
Please.

00:14:57.405 --> 00:14:59.038
Now I...

00:15:00.338 --> 00:15:02.572
truly can't stand you anymore.

00:15:30.005 --> 00:15:32.638
If even this place turns cold,

00:15:34.205 --> 00:15:36.772
where should I go now?

00:15:42.705 --> 00:15:44.672
Both His Majesty and the Left Minister

00:15:44.672 --> 00:15:48.472
will come looking for you to clean up this mess.

00:15:48.472 --> 00:15:50.272
Have me expelled from the palace.

00:15:50.272 --> 00:15:53.672
For now, I'll hide in Prince Je Woon's residence.

00:15:53.672 --> 00:15:58.472
Even the Left Minister can't raid
a prince's home without justification.

00:15:58.472 --> 00:15:59.872
But,

00:15:59.872 --> 00:16:01.601
would the Grand Queen Dowager

00:16:01.601 --> 00:16:03.772
stay silent?

00:16:04.905 --> 00:16:07.138
If it's revealed she brought me in,

00:16:07.138 --> 00:16:08.872
the sparks will reach Her Majesty too.

00:16:08.872 --> 00:16:11.805
She won't make any moves for now.

00:16:11.805 --> 00:16:14.838
I'll go to Boryeong and keep your family safe.

00:16:14.838 --> 00:16:16.538
While I'm away,

00:16:20.672 --> 00:16:22.505
hold on tight.

00:16:40.072 --> 00:16:42.238
Your Majesty!

00:16:42.238 --> 00:16:44.938
Please depose the Crown Prince
corrupted by his unnatural desires

00:16:44.938 --> 00:16:47.905
and set the nation back on its righteous path.

00:16:47.905 --> 00:16:51.805
- Restore order.
- Restore order.

00:16:51.805 --> 00:16:53.738
[Gwanghwamun]
Your Majesty.

00:16:53.738 --> 00:16:56.072
How dare anyone claim
the Crown Prince practices sodomy?

00:16:57.438 --> 00:17:00.705
How dare anyone speak such a disgraceful thing?

00:17:00.705 --> 00:17:03.505
It is said that the eunuch
who dragged His Highness

00:17:03.505 --> 00:17:06.405
into scandal entered the palace
under a false identity.

00:17:06.405 --> 00:17:08.005
We've deployed constables to track him down.

00:17:08.005 --> 00:17:09.672
Once captured,

00:17:09.672 --> 00:17:12.738
Your Majesty should personally
oversee the execution

00:17:12.738 --> 00:17:15.538
to silence these rumors.

00:17:15.538 --> 00:17:17.205
Make it happen.

00:17:17.205 --> 00:17:20.172
Find out who spread the rumors immediately,

00:17:20.172 --> 00:17:23.672
and apprehend that treasonous eunuch
who defamed the Crown Prince.

00:17:23.672 --> 00:17:26.872
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

00:17:33.659 --> 00:17:36.638
[Liquor]

00:17:36.638 --> 00:17:38.672
- Madam?
- Yes, sir.

00:17:38.672 --> 00:17:40.838
Have you seen this man?

00:17:40.838 --> 00:17:41.972
I'm not sure.

00:17:41.972 --> 00:17:43.572
Look carefully.

00:18:50.638 --> 00:18:54.472
'Crown Princes don't pray,' he said.

00:18:54.472 --> 00:18:57.172
Why is he behaving this way lately?

00:19:09.305 --> 00:19:11.572
How pathetic.

00:19:11.572 --> 00:19:13.805
Praying to mere trees?

00:19:19.972 --> 00:19:21.772
That so-called Heaven

00:19:21.772 --> 00:19:24.172
should have some conscience.

00:19:24.172 --> 00:19:26.738
With basic decency,
you shouldn't treat me this way.

00:19:26.738 --> 00:19:28.505
You took everything from me.

00:19:28.505 --> 00:19:31.705
My mother, the Crown Princess, even my own body.

00:19:31.705 --> 00:19:33.805
So this time, please...

00:19:36.472 --> 00:19:38.138
answer my prayer.

00:19:41.205 --> 00:19:43.972
Then I'll stop cursing you

00:19:43.972 --> 00:19:46.005
and hold no resentment.

00:19:47.905 --> 00:19:50.372
Just protect this...

00:19:53.605 --> 00:19:55.205
Dal I's body.

00:19:56.472 --> 00:19:58.105
Please.

00:20:13.138 --> 00:20:15.138
Please spare me, sir.

00:20:15.138 --> 00:20:17.838
This might endanger you too,

00:20:17.838 --> 00:20:19.438
but Dal I...

00:20:22.505 --> 00:20:24.097
Please

00:20:24.097 --> 00:20:25.572
save me.

00:20:25.572 --> 00:20:27.905
You saved my daughter's life.

00:20:27.905 --> 00:20:30.338
How could a true man ignore this?

00:20:30.338 --> 00:20:31.572
Speak.

00:20:31.572 --> 00:20:33.838
How can I assist?

00:20:35.638 --> 00:20:38.497
Use these to relocate my family

00:20:38.497 --> 00:20:40.538
and take me in.

00:20:49.872 --> 00:20:52.605
I'll trust only you.

00:20:52.605 --> 00:20:56.172
Are you leaving without even
having a meal or seeing your family?

00:20:56.172 --> 00:21:01.438
The Left Minister will investigate
since they find out I left the palace.

00:21:01.438 --> 00:21:04.338
If anyone sees me with the trading post members,

00:21:04.338 --> 00:21:06.272
disaster may follow.

00:21:06.272 --> 00:21:08.905
I must hurry before getting caught.

00:21:08.905 --> 00:21:12.338
I saw your foot was hurt.

00:21:17.005 --> 00:21:19.645
How did Dal I

00:21:19.645 --> 00:21:21.905
endure this?

00:21:25.805 --> 00:21:28.005
I never realized

00:21:28.005 --> 00:21:30.401
that a life on the run

00:21:30.401 --> 00:21:32.672
could be

00:21:32.672 --> 00:21:34.938
this harsh and lonely.

00:21:38.472 --> 00:21:40.538
What do you mean?

00:21:40.538 --> 00:21:42.572
Dal I's your wife's niece?

00:21:42.572 --> 00:21:44.372
Dal I requested it.

00:21:44.372 --> 00:21:46.472
She seems in grave danger.

00:21:46.472 --> 00:21:48.738
I'll hide her under my protection.

00:21:48.738 --> 00:21:51.438
You should close the trading post

00:21:51.438 --> 00:21:53.272
and go into hiding.

00:21:53.272 --> 00:21:54.572
Dal I's in danger?

00:21:54.572 --> 00:21:56.172
Where is she now?

00:21:56.172 --> 00:21:57.738
I can't tell you.

00:21:57.738 --> 00:22:01.605
I won't take a single step
from here until you explain.

00:22:01.605 --> 00:22:03.405
Even if I die, I won't go.

00:22:03.405 --> 00:22:04.609
So please,

00:22:04.609 --> 00:22:06.705
tell me!

00:22:11.972 --> 00:22:13.572
What do you mean by that?

00:22:13.572 --> 00:22:14.972
You cut off everything

00:22:14.972 --> 00:22:16.905
and suddenly say Dal I isn't our daughter anymore!

00:22:16.905 --> 00:22:18.538
Even though she's not my biological child,

00:22:18.538 --> 00:22:20.705
we've spent five years as family.

00:22:20.705 --> 00:22:22.605
How can you suddenly take someone else's daughter

00:22:22.605 --> 00:22:24.438
without any proper explanation?

00:22:24.438 --> 00:22:25.972
No time for explanations.

00:22:25.972 --> 00:22:27.605
It's probably better if you don't know.

00:22:27.605 --> 00:22:29.605
From now on,

00:22:29.605 --> 00:22:33.205
go your separate ways.

00:22:34.605 --> 00:22:36.872
Who ever asked for money!

00:22:38.338 --> 00:22:40.338
Are you the heavens, or Samsin?

00:22:40.338 --> 00:22:44.205
You may have brought Dal I to us,

00:22:44.205 --> 00:22:46.372
- but the one who will cut that bond is us!
- Exactly.

00:22:46.372 --> 00:22:48.838
Dal I went to Hanyang.

00:22:49.805 --> 00:22:53.438
I'll leave Joseon with her.

00:22:53.438 --> 00:22:55.838
You two might be in danger.

00:22:55.838 --> 00:22:58.038
I can't explain fully,

00:22:58.038 --> 00:23:02.672
but Dal I's secret is bigger than slave hunters.

00:23:02.672 --> 00:23:04.672
So what?

00:23:07.038 --> 00:23:10.238
When Dal I first came, you told me

00:23:10.238 --> 00:23:15.138
to live as a normal family of three,
to appear ordinary like everyone else.

00:23:15.138 --> 00:23:19.238
Though she felt guilty for burdening me,

00:23:19.238 --> 00:23:21.305
I cherished it.

00:23:21.305 --> 00:23:26.538
It felt like permission for me
to live an ordinary life too.

00:23:27.905 --> 00:23:30.805
So I'll remain Dal I's mother.

00:23:31.638 --> 00:23:33.905
Even if things get dangerous,

00:23:33.905 --> 00:23:36.772
I've chosen to live that way.

00:23:39.105 --> 00:23:40.338
Right.

00:23:40.338 --> 00:23:42.938
We've always been experts at twisting fate itself.

00:23:42.938 --> 00:23:44.738
I'll live my life my way, no matter what!

00:23:44.738 --> 00:23:47.005
Whether we're braiding sandals
or twisting fates elsewhere,

00:23:47.005 --> 00:23:49.972
we'll live happily enough to make others envy us,

00:23:49.972 --> 00:23:51.572
so let's go together.

00:23:52.238 --> 00:23:54.105
You lead the way.

00:23:54.105 --> 00:23:56.238
You said our daughter's in danger.

00:24:00.705 --> 00:24:02.038
Left Minister.

00:24:02.038 --> 00:24:04.072
We've caught the court lady
who spread the scandal.

00:24:04.072 --> 00:24:06.338
- Kill her.
- Well...

00:24:06.338 --> 00:24:07.937
That court lady

00:24:07.937 --> 00:24:09.805
is the niece of Chief Court Lady.

00:24:09.805 --> 00:24:10.805
Who's behind this?

00:24:10.805 --> 00:24:14.038
There's no mastermind.
It seems like it was just a reckless rumor.

00:24:14.038 --> 00:24:17.072
Besides, the rumors weren't entirely baseless.

00:24:18.572 --> 00:24:20.272
What should we do?

00:24:22.138 --> 00:24:26.905
We've used Chief Court Lady enough.

00:24:31.905 --> 00:24:33.538
Aunt.

00:24:37.105 --> 00:24:39.169
Why on earth

00:24:39.169 --> 00:24:41.038
did you do this?

00:24:41.038 --> 00:24:43.938
Why did you do something like this?

00:24:43.938 --> 00:24:45.805
It's unfair.

00:24:46.972 --> 00:24:49.372
Bissi tried to kill the Crown Prince,

00:24:49.372 --> 00:24:51.605
and she ordered the assassination too.

00:24:51.605 --> 00:24:54.205
The Grand Queen Dowager knew everything.

00:24:54.205 --> 00:24:56.472
Why is only Chief Secretary being exiled?

00:24:56.472 --> 00:25:00.072
Why only him? Why?

00:25:03.205 --> 00:25:04.801
You...

00:25:05.857 --> 00:25:06.938
Could it be...

00:25:06.938 --> 00:25:08.572
Yes.

00:25:09.705 --> 00:25:12.005
I am his beloved.

00:25:12.005 --> 00:25:14.138
He's my lover.

00:25:15.872 --> 00:25:17.372
My lord!

00:25:17.372 --> 00:25:20.472
Please spare my niece.

00:25:20.472 --> 00:25:25.005
I thought I would use you for a long time,
but now it's unfortunate.

00:25:25.905 --> 00:25:27.745
I've learned

00:25:27.745 --> 00:25:29.905
about that porter, Park Dal I.

00:25:29.905 --> 00:25:32.305
Now that the Crown Prince's interest has shifted,

00:25:32.305 --> 00:25:34.072
what does that girl matter?

00:25:34.072 --> 00:25:36.872
Why would the Crown Prince suddenly lose interest?

00:25:36.872 --> 00:25:39.138
Where could

00:25:39.138 --> 00:25:43.905
a eunuch resembling a deposed consort
have appeared overnight?

00:25:49.105 --> 00:25:51.572
You haven't caught that eunuch yet?

00:25:51.572 --> 00:25:53.605
[Gye Gwan]
We're searching, Your Majesty.

00:25:53.605 --> 00:25:57.738
But once you catch him, what will you do?

00:25:57.738 --> 00:25:59.872
Are you going to execute him?

00:25:59.872 --> 00:26:01.905
He must be executed.

00:26:01.905 --> 00:26:04.737
Receive the imperial command,

00:26:04.737 --> 00:26:06.305
Your Highness.

00:26:08.138 --> 00:26:09.538
What?

00:26:09.538 --> 00:26:11.521
Hand over

00:26:11.521 --> 00:26:14.172
that eunuch, Your Highness.

00:26:15.272 --> 00:26:17.105
What do you mean by that?

00:26:17.105 --> 00:26:20.405
Are you saying the Crown Prince hid that eunuch?

00:26:29.072 --> 00:26:30.505
I apologize.

00:26:30.505 --> 00:26:32.005
End me now, Your Highness.

00:26:32.005 --> 00:26:33.638
End me now, Your Highness.

00:26:33.638 --> 00:26:35.138
It's fine.

00:26:35.138 --> 00:26:37.705
Left Guard Officer, bring a sword.

00:26:37.705 --> 00:26:39.505
Pardon?

00:26:39.505 --> 00:26:41.338
Why a sword?

00:26:41.338 --> 00:26:44.738
You must punish this traitor who dared

00:26:44.738 --> 00:26:47.905
spill tea on Your Highness' robes.

00:26:47.905 --> 00:26:51.838
Calling it treason over spilled tea?

00:26:51.838 --> 00:26:53.438
Bring

00:26:54.972 --> 00:26:56.672
the sword.

00:26:58.272 --> 00:26:59.938
Bring it.

00:26:59.938 --> 00:27:01.572
Your Majesty.

00:27:19.638 --> 00:27:24.472
Do you think protecting her now
will save her forever?

00:27:24.472 --> 00:27:28.705
I must protect her now,
or there won't be a next step, will there?

00:27:29.505 --> 00:27:31.138
So,

00:27:31.838 --> 00:27:34.049
did Park Dal I

00:27:34.049 --> 00:27:38.272
also hide behind you, Your Highness?

00:27:38.272 --> 00:27:40.705
Do you think I wouldn't know?

00:27:40.705 --> 00:27:42.438
That eunuch,

00:27:42.438 --> 00:27:43.838
no,

00:27:43.838 --> 00:27:45.729
that woman

00:27:45.729 --> 00:27:48.305
is actually Park Dal I.

00:27:53.238 --> 00:27:55.472
What nonsense is this?

00:27:55.472 --> 00:27:57.305
A woman?

00:27:58.438 --> 00:28:00.672
Is the Left Minister's claim true?

00:28:12.305 --> 00:28:13.938
Anyone here?

00:28:16.538 --> 00:28:18.238
Why isn't anyone here?

00:28:19.738 --> 00:28:21.405
Hey.

00:28:24.238 --> 00:28:26.272
I'll send another message.

00:28:35.873 --> 00:28:37.038
Hey, wait.

00:28:37.038 --> 00:28:38.438
Oh, come on.

00:28:38.438 --> 00:28:40.805
Let go!

00:28:40.805 --> 00:28:42.572
Why are you grabbing a woman's wrist like that?

00:28:42.572 --> 00:28:44.638
With your status as a fugitive,
where do you think you're going?

00:28:44.638 --> 00:28:46.705
What will you do if you get yourself in danger?

00:28:46.705 --> 00:28:48.072
Who are you supposed to be, Hong Gil Dong?

00:28:48.072 --> 00:28:49.305
One moment you're a woman, then a man,

00:28:49.305 --> 00:28:51.338
then a porter, and now a eunuch?

00:28:51.338 --> 00:28:54.738
The Grand Queen Dowager forced me
into this, so I had no choice...

00:28:55.572 --> 00:28:57.238
Enough.

00:28:58.705 --> 00:29:02.105
More importantly, why did you
come to Donggung Palace at dawn?

00:29:02.105 --> 00:29:04.472
Could that Qing man just now

00:29:04.472 --> 00:29:08.138
possibly be the messenger
bringing news of the Zhen bird?

00:29:09.838 --> 00:29:11.938
How do you know about that?

00:29:13.705 --> 00:29:16.672
Did His Highness tell you even that?

00:29:16.672 --> 00:29:19.505
Well...

00:29:22.838 --> 00:29:26.305
Yes, the Gyesa Year incident,
Zhen birds, everything.

00:29:26.305 --> 00:29:30.105
I know more than anyone, so you can tell me.

00:29:30.105 --> 00:29:34.105
Has there been news from Qing?

00:29:35.538 --> 00:29:38.838
Why should I trust you with such crucial matters?

00:29:38.838 --> 00:29:41.072
I'll speak to my cousin directly, so stop prying.

00:29:41.072 --> 00:29:43.905
No, I'm telling you, talking to him
won't do any good.

00:29:46.705 --> 00:29:48.105
Then again,

00:29:48.105 --> 00:29:49.772
what good would it do even if I heard it?

00:29:49.772 --> 00:29:51.505
I'm just a fugitive.

00:29:55.772 --> 00:29:57.738
What are you doing? Get out!

00:29:57.738 --> 00:29:59.472
Hey, this is my house!

00:29:59.472 --> 00:30:02.105
You know everything about the situation too.

00:30:02.105 --> 00:30:05.338
Let me hide behind you
for a while, my lord, alright?

00:30:10.638 --> 00:30:14.338
Dal I, do you want to hide
behind me your whole life?

00:30:15.272 --> 00:30:17.638
So why don't you go ahead and pray for me

00:30:17.638 --> 00:30:21.038
to be running around for the rest of my life?

00:30:21.038 --> 00:30:23.772
No, stay by my side.

00:30:23.772 --> 00:30:25.672
Marry me.

00:30:27.572 --> 00:30:29.505
What nonsense is this?

00:30:29.505 --> 00:30:34.638
If we marry, the Left Minister
will lower his guard against you.

00:30:34.638 --> 00:30:35.938
Right.

00:30:35.938 --> 00:30:39.305
You know my circumstances, so I'll hide nothing.

00:30:40.038 --> 00:30:42.272
If I keep watching you,

00:30:42.272 --> 00:30:45.638
I'm worried my cousin will
either give up on his revenge

00:30:45.638 --> 00:30:50.438
or, even worse, his resentment towards Woo Hee
will grow, and the wedding will be called off.

00:30:50.438 --> 00:30:52.105
You'll be safe,

00:30:52.105 --> 00:30:55.272
and I'll be happy if the royal wedding
proceeds smoothly.

00:30:55.272 --> 00:30:57.038
Think about it.

00:30:59.438 --> 00:31:01.438
Listen, Prince.

00:31:03.938 --> 00:31:05.872
Snap out of it.

00:31:07.072 --> 00:31:09.305
I'll protect myself.

00:31:25.905 --> 00:31:29.905
Seems the Crown Prince hasn't
recovered from nearly drowning.

00:31:30.705 --> 00:31:32.638
I hope you understand, Left Minister.

00:31:32.638 --> 00:31:35.405
If it were about His Highness' health,

00:31:35.405 --> 00:31:37.972
I'd support you

00:31:37.972 --> 00:31:40.638
a hundred, a thousand times over.

00:31:40.638 --> 00:31:45.738
But if Your Majesty have taken a different mind,

00:31:47.972 --> 00:31:50.002
who can guarantee

00:31:50.002 --> 00:31:53.172
that the Gyesa Year Incident

00:31:54.072 --> 00:31:55.938
won't happen again?

00:31:55.938 --> 00:31:57.538
Left Minister.

00:33:33.772 --> 00:33:35.805
Looking for this?

00:33:35.805 --> 00:33:38.638
Father still keeps you around, I see.

00:33:39.505 --> 00:33:42.705
Even after you helped me
attempt to kill the Crown Prince

00:33:42.705 --> 00:33:46.505
and delivered his letters to me.

00:33:46.505 --> 00:33:48.372
He's peculiar.

00:33:48.372 --> 00:33:52.472
No matter how dangerous,
he won't discard useful tools.

00:33:52.472 --> 00:33:57.038
You, me, even the Zhen birds.

00:34:09.772 --> 00:34:12.172
Hand over that eunuch.

00:34:13.238 --> 00:34:15.297
If I do,

00:34:15.297 --> 00:34:16.872
she'll die.

00:34:16.872 --> 00:34:19.972
If you pity her, I'll make her a government slave

00:34:19.972 --> 00:34:22.805
and spare her life.

00:34:22.805 --> 00:34:24.472
No.

00:34:27.305 --> 00:34:28.929
Gang,

00:34:28.929 --> 00:34:31.372
don't oppose the Left Minister.

00:34:32.172 --> 00:34:35.272
The Gyesa Year incident isn't over.

00:34:35.272 --> 00:34:37.938
Think of the Queen who died for you
and my father-in-law

00:34:37.938 --> 00:34:40.372
and the deposed Crown Princess.

00:34:41.005 --> 00:34:44.938
Will you abandon both revenge
and future over one eunuch?

00:34:47.672 --> 00:34:49.372
Revenge?

00:34:50.072 --> 00:34:53.638
That's why I killed the Queen,

00:34:54.438 --> 00:34:57.405
and framed the deposed Crown Princess.

00:34:57.405 --> 00:35:02.738
And that's why Your Highness chose
death over revenge, isn't it?

00:35:02.738 --> 00:35:04.705
How pathetic.

00:35:19.638 --> 00:35:22.072
Save this for your future use.

00:35:22.072 --> 00:35:23.938
When the Left Minister falls,

00:35:23.938 --> 00:35:26.272
you'll need your own weapon to keep

00:35:26.272 --> 00:35:28.905
the Grand Queen Dowager from seizing power.

00:35:28.905 --> 00:35:30.675
Forgive me

00:35:30.675 --> 00:35:33.405
for this, Father.

00:35:33.405 --> 00:35:35.172
Come here.

00:35:36.538 --> 00:35:38.817
What are you saying now?

00:35:38.817 --> 00:35:40.572
Well...

00:35:40.572 --> 00:35:44.105
You should go turn yourself in.

00:35:45.238 --> 00:35:48.205
If you're dealt with in front of the ministers,

00:35:48.205 --> 00:35:50.338
the rumors about the Crown Prince's
homosexuality will disappear.

00:35:50.338 --> 00:35:52.405
His Majesty will show mercy

00:35:52.405 --> 00:35:55.672
and only make you a slave if you go now.

00:35:58.005 --> 00:36:01.705
You know the immediate suffering
will fall on Your Highness,

00:36:01.705 --> 00:36:04.905
but there's no alternative.

00:36:04.905 --> 00:36:08.538
I'll make sure to give you back your body.

00:36:09.738 --> 00:36:12.338
Besides, I was born a slave.

00:36:12.338 --> 00:36:16.038
Returning to slavery means nothing.

00:36:19.605 --> 00:36:23.238
I've been running day and night,
traveling between Boryeong and Hanyang.

00:36:23.238 --> 00:36:24.638
I stayed, afraid of being caught,

00:36:24.638 --> 00:36:26.838
yet still

00:36:26.838 --> 00:36:28.872
my heart suffered more than my body.

00:36:28.872 --> 00:36:30.805
You must have lived this way your whole life.

00:36:30.805 --> 00:36:32.449
But

00:36:32.449 --> 00:36:34.705
is there really nothing to feel wronged about?

00:36:34.705 --> 00:36:36.705
Why be such a fool?

00:36:39.038 --> 00:36:40.838
What else can I do?

00:36:41.472 --> 00:36:45.472
If you don't bring me in,
and if you go against the Left Minister,

00:36:45.472 --> 00:36:47.805
they say the revenge for the Crown Princess

00:36:47.805 --> 00:36:50.505
and your entire future will all be ruined.

00:36:51.905 --> 00:36:56.405
I know how Your Highness feels
every waking moment.

00:36:56.405 --> 00:36:59.338
I've dreamed it myself.

00:36:59.338 --> 00:37:02.672
How could I destroy your future?

00:37:14.005 --> 00:37:15.638
Don't cry

00:37:15.638 --> 00:37:17.372
with that face.

00:37:36.805 --> 00:37:38.438
I said don't cry.

00:37:38.438 --> 00:37:40.272
I'll fix this.

00:37:43.938 --> 00:37:45.638
So stop crying,

00:37:45.638 --> 00:37:46.638
okay?

00:37:46.638 --> 00:37:51.472
How will you fix it?

00:37:56.872 --> 00:37:58.705
A dirty fight.

00:38:13.338 --> 00:38:15.372
Why are you here?

00:38:16.105 --> 00:38:18.205
What are you doing?

00:38:18.205 --> 00:38:21.272
I came to take you to the Left Minister.

00:38:21.272 --> 00:38:22.905
What?

00:38:30.405 --> 00:38:33.905
How could they look so alike?

00:38:33.905 --> 00:38:35.777
What grave sin

00:38:35.777 --> 00:38:38.605
have I committed?

00:38:38.605 --> 00:38:41.538
A woman disguised herself
as a eunuch to enter the palace.

00:38:41.538 --> 00:38:45.105
According to the Great Code of State,

00:38:45.105 --> 00:38:48.672
the punishment is 100 lashes,
exile, and hard labor.

00:38:48.672 --> 00:38:51.038
The law seems quite systematic.

00:38:52.338 --> 00:38:54.038
Understood.

00:38:54.038 --> 00:38:55.972
Then I'll follow the law.

00:38:55.972 --> 00:38:59.137
Because I committed such deception

00:38:59.137 --> 00:39:01.538
in this sacred palace.

00:39:02.238 --> 00:39:04.438
I'll likely be beaten to death anyway,

00:39:04.438 --> 00:39:07.138
but may I ask one question?

00:39:07.138 --> 00:39:11.638
What punishment is given to
a nobleman who molests or tries

00:39:11.638 --> 00:39:13.872
to force himself on a woman?

00:39:13.872 --> 00:39:18.205
There's a section in the Great Code of State.

00:39:18.205 --> 00:39:20.205
What does it say there?

00:39:24.038 --> 00:39:26.305
Well...

00:39:26.305 --> 00:39:28.572
According to the laws, sexual misconduct

00:39:28.572 --> 00:39:32.305
for forcibly harassing women
or causing sexual humiliation

00:39:32.305 --> 00:39:34.105
warrants 50 to 80 cane strikes,

00:39:34.105 --> 00:39:36.572
and 80 to 100 lashes with a rod.

00:39:36.572 --> 00:39:39.605
Also, nobles face exile or dismissal from office.

00:39:39.605 --> 00:39:41.205
For royalty or high-ranking officials,

00:39:41.205 --> 00:39:44.238
execution is permissible by royal decree.

00:39:44.238 --> 00:39:48.405
How shameful for a law officer
to not know the code?

00:39:48.405 --> 00:39:49.638
Truly pathetic.

00:39:49.638 --> 00:39:51.505
Oh, is that so?

00:39:51.505 --> 00:39:54.405
Then I'll file one accusation.

00:39:54.405 --> 00:39:56.372
The Minister of Personnel standing there

00:39:56.372 --> 00:39:58.805
publicly harassed me at Donhwamun Gate

00:39:58.805 --> 00:40:00.605
and untied my clothes.

00:40:00.605 --> 00:40:03.605
Is that acceptable by law?

00:40:04.505 --> 00:40:05.572
No!

00:40:05.572 --> 00:40:08.105
This is absurd. What nonsense!

00:40:09.738 --> 00:40:12.272
You are that porter, huh?

00:40:15.672 --> 00:40:18.638
How will you fix it?

00:40:20.605 --> 00:40:22.238
A dirty fight.

00:40:25.238 --> 00:40:27.938
I saw it.

00:40:27.938 --> 00:40:30.272
I witnessed it clearly with my own eyes.

00:40:30.272 --> 00:40:32.738
Left Minister, that's not... I mean...

00:40:32.738 --> 00:40:36.472
How can the Minister of Personnel
chase women so brazenly?

00:40:36.472 --> 00:40:37.838
No sense of decency.

00:40:37.838 --> 00:40:39.538
Then, it seems that the Minister of War,

00:40:39.538 --> 00:40:41.172
who is responsible for military command,

00:40:41.172 --> 00:40:44.372
feels perfectly justified in embezzling
the army's provisions, huh?

00:40:44.372 --> 00:40:45.405
Look at that belly.

00:40:45.405 --> 00:40:47.272
That's all from the stolen rations.

00:40:47.272 --> 00:40:49.438
What baseless accusation is that?

00:40:49.438 --> 00:40:51.205
It was the Minister of Finance
who stole the rations.

00:40:51.205 --> 00:40:53.772
I only sold military exemption papers...

00:40:53.772 --> 00:40:57.138
Why are you dragging me into this mess?

00:40:57.138 --> 00:40:58.972
Am I the only villain here?

00:40:58.972 --> 00:41:03.672
The Seoul Magistrate gambles
with the bribes he takes, doesn't he?

00:41:03.672 --> 00:41:05.205
Gambling's the issue?

00:41:05.205 --> 00:41:08.138
Better than bribing shamans and fortune-tellers.

00:41:08.138 --> 00:41:11.905
With the Chief Scholar acting like that,
even Neo-Confucianism itself would weep.

00:41:11.905 --> 00:41:14.405
No, that's...

00:41:23.405 --> 00:41:24.993
Now,

00:41:24.993 --> 00:41:26.805
are you finished?

00:41:30.872 --> 00:41:34.605
Let only the sinless cast stones at me.

00:41:34.605 --> 00:41:38.738
Well, that seems fair.

00:41:38.738 --> 00:41:43.472
Yes, we should get rid of the rats
feeding off this nation.

00:41:43.472 --> 00:41:47.572
I'll expose and punish every
corrupt minister in this court.

00:41:47.572 --> 00:41:51.238
- Left Minister.
- Left Minister.

00:41:51.238 --> 00:41:57.038
Therefore, Your Highness,
first punish Park Dal I today.

00:42:01.505 --> 00:42:04.472
If you feel any pity,
I'll make her a government slave

00:42:04.472 --> 00:42:07.238
to spare her life.

00:42:07.238 --> 00:42:10.172
100 lashes would kill her anyway.

00:42:10.172 --> 00:42:12.705
Instead, send her far away.

00:42:12.705 --> 00:42:15.205
Make her a slave on Jeju Island.

00:42:15.205 --> 00:42:16.872
Jeju Island?

00:42:16.872 --> 00:42:17.938
A government slave?

00:42:17.938 --> 00:42:19.605
It would benefit you as well, Left Minister.

00:42:19.605 --> 00:42:21.972
Soon to become the Royal Father-in-Law,

00:42:21.972 --> 00:42:23.572
if that girl dies under lashes,

00:42:23.572 --> 00:42:26.105
the public will mock the Bissi relentlessly.

00:42:26.105 --> 00:42:29.072
Please, at least protect Bissi's dignity.

00:42:29.072 --> 00:42:31.672
Your Highness, Jeju Island?

00:42:31.672 --> 00:42:32.838
A government slave?

00:42:32.838 --> 00:42:34.772
Give the order, Your Highness.

00:42:34.772 --> 00:42:38.172
Only Your Highness' direct punishment
can quell rumors.

00:42:38.172 --> 00:42:39.805
Your Highness.

00:42:41.138 --> 00:42:43.205
Do not oppose the Left Minister.

00:42:43.205 --> 00:42:45.872
Think of the Queen who died for you
and my father-in-law

00:42:45.872 --> 00:42:48.205
and the deposed Crown Princess.

00:42:53.538 --> 00:42:55.172
Send Park...

00:42:56.638 --> 00:42:59.438
Park Dal I

00:42:59.438 --> 00:43:01.072
to Jeju Island...

00:43:01.738 --> 00:43:02.972
As a government slave...

00:43:02.972 --> 00:43:06.705
Her Majesty the Grand Queen Dowager has arrived!

00:43:25.272 --> 00:43:27.205
Please release this girl.

00:43:27.205 --> 00:43:31.238
With all due respect,
this isn't Your Majesty's concern.

00:43:31.238 --> 00:43:32.505
No.

00:43:32.505 --> 00:43:34.705
It is my concern.

00:43:34.705 --> 00:43:37.972
This girl belongs to me.

00:43:40.372 --> 00:43:42.005
Give that to me.

00:43:45.972 --> 00:43:47.638
What are you doing?

00:43:49.405 --> 00:43:51.705
I've served His Highness since the day I was born.

00:43:51.705 --> 00:43:53.372
If anyone dies because of His Highness,

00:43:53.372 --> 00:43:55.572
he will never be able to live with himself.

00:43:55.572 --> 00:43:57.572
He is not such a cruel man.

00:43:57.572 --> 00:43:59.238
Give me that.

00:43:59.972 --> 00:44:01.538
So, go.

00:44:01.538 --> 00:44:04.972
Take this and plead with Her Majesty
the Grand Queen Dowager.

00:44:04.972 --> 00:44:07.438
So His Highness won't be hurt...

00:44:27.072 --> 00:44:29.038
Please spare me, Your Majesty.

00:44:29.038 --> 00:44:32.705
I brought Park Dal I into the palace as a eunuch.

00:44:32.705 --> 00:44:36.438
I wished to reward her for saving
the Crown Prince's life at the Sinjusa Temple

00:44:36.438 --> 00:44:38.872
by appointing her as a court lady,

00:44:38.872 --> 00:44:41.805
but then I recalled
how the Chief Court Lady drove out

00:44:41.805 --> 00:44:43.905
so many maids without reason.

00:44:44.572 --> 00:44:47.138
This girl resembling the deceased
deposed Crown Princess.

00:44:47.138 --> 00:44:49.772
It was clear she'd be expelled,

00:44:49.772 --> 00:44:52.638
I merely showed her minor consideration.

00:44:52.638 --> 00:44:54.401
How could you,

00:44:54.401 --> 00:44:56.205
a great elder of the royal family

00:44:56.205 --> 00:44:59.172
treat palace law so lightly?

00:44:59.172 --> 00:45:01.382
Regulations?

00:45:01.382 --> 00:45:02.905
Splendid.

00:45:02.905 --> 00:45:06.372
That day, Bissi who didn't even
complete the wedding rites

00:45:06.372 --> 00:45:10.838
opened the Crown Prince's chambers
herself without reporting it.

00:45:10.838 --> 00:45:15.272
Then, Bissi and the corrupt officials alike

00:45:15.272 --> 00:45:17.972
should all be punished accordingly.

00:45:19.372 --> 00:45:21.638
Shall we go over

00:45:21.638 --> 00:45:24.568
each offense

00:45:24.568 --> 00:45:27.038
one by one?

00:45:41.538 --> 00:45:42.772
Your Majesty.

00:45:42.772 --> 00:45:46.438
I will never forget your mercy
for as long as I live.

00:45:48.872 --> 00:45:50.505
You'd better not.

00:45:50.505 --> 00:45:52.905
Though she is a court lady for now,

00:45:52.905 --> 00:45:56.005
make her a royal concubine soon.

00:45:56.005 --> 00:45:57.605
Pardon?

00:46:00.238 --> 00:46:03.172
A royal concubine? That's preposterous.

00:46:03.172 --> 00:46:04.672
Preposterous, you say?

00:46:04.672 --> 00:46:06.605
What nonsense is this?

00:46:06.605 --> 00:46:09.072
I haven't even performed
the wedding rites with Bissi yet.

00:46:09.072 --> 00:46:12.138
How could I take a concubine first?

00:46:12.138 --> 00:46:14.872
Moreover, she's now a court lady.

00:46:14.872 --> 00:46:18.072
I fear incurring His Majesty's wrath.

00:46:18.072 --> 00:46:21.438
A man shouldn't have so many fears.

00:46:22.072 --> 00:46:24.805
Is losing one Crown Princess not enough for you?

00:46:24.805 --> 00:46:28.272
Are you planning to let this girl die
at the hands of the Left Minister as well?

00:46:29.338 --> 00:46:32.172
The Crown Princess is pitiful.

00:46:32.172 --> 00:46:36.338
She gave her heart to such
a cowardly man and left this world.

00:46:41.005 --> 00:46:44.872
Your Majesty, you're going too far.

00:46:44.872 --> 00:46:48.105
Though I may be an old woman in the back quarters,

00:46:48.105 --> 00:46:51.338
I still lead this nation's inner court.

00:46:52.005 --> 00:46:54.372
Do as I say!

00:47:24.172 --> 00:47:25.838
Would you like to try it?

00:47:25.838 --> 00:47:28.572
It will make you feel all warm

00:47:28.572 --> 00:47:30.638
and bubbly inside.

00:48:39.805 --> 00:48:41.505
What's that supposed to mean?

00:48:41.505 --> 00:48:43.738
So, it wasn't Woo Hee who spread the scandal?

00:48:43.738 --> 00:48:46.572
Why suddenly bring up Lady Bissi?

00:48:46.572 --> 00:48:48.405
The Chief Court Lady's niece spread it.

00:48:48.405 --> 00:48:51.138
Yeo Ri from Woo Hee's household said so.

00:48:51.138 --> 00:48:52.872
Give it to me.

00:48:57.238 --> 00:49:01.105
Let's never see each other again.

00:49:01.838 --> 00:49:03.572
Now I...

00:49:03.572 --> 00:49:05.772
truly can't stand you anymore.

00:49:07.438 --> 00:49:09.505
What have I done...

00:49:23.472 --> 00:49:25.652
The Grand Queen Dowager

00:49:25.652 --> 00:49:27.372
is being too harsh.

00:49:27.372 --> 00:49:31.672
It's as if she had assigned you
to a concubine's position.

00:49:32.638 --> 00:49:35.072
That's why she spared my life.

00:49:39.338 --> 00:49:41.438
I heard from the Left Guard Officer that

00:49:41.438 --> 00:49:44.738
you threatened her with accusations of treason.

00:49:44.738 --> 00:49:46.172
What more is there?

00:49:46.172 --> 00:49:48.838
Why? What did you say?

00:49:48.838 --> 00:49:50.172
Did you think I would be frightened

00:49:50.172 --> 00:49:52.972
if you threatened me?

00:49:52.972 --> 00:49:56.872
If I deny it, that's the end of it.

00:49:56.872 --> 00:50:00.338
If Your Majesty denies it,
the world will believe you.

00:50:00.338 --> 00:50:05.405
But surely, Your Majesty cannot deceive yourself.

00:50:05.405 --> 00:50:08.072
I'm not trying to threaten Your Majesty.

00:50:08.072 --> 00:50:10.672
I'm proving my usefulness.

00:50:11.638 --> 00:50:15.972
Look not at this medicine bowl,
but look at me who brought it.

00:50:17.572 --> 00:50:21.438
You're carrying such an important item.

00:50:21.438 --> 00:50:24.993
Does that mean you're now that close

00:50:24.993 --> 00:50:26.497
to the Crown Prince?

00:50:26.497 --> 00:50:28.205
Yes.

00:50:29.538 --> 00:50:32.605
Did the Crown Prince say so?

00:50:32.605 --> 00:50:34.913
Did he say

00:50:34.913 --> 00:50:36.638
'I hold you in my heart'?

00:50:36.638 --> 00:50:39.605
He hasn't voiced it yet.

00:50:41.238 --> 00:50:43.905
But His Highness clearly

00:50:43.905 --> 00:50:45.938
has feelings for Park Dal I...

00:50:45.938 --> 00:50:48.272
I said that

00:50:48.272 --> 00:50:50.113
the Crown Prince

00:50:50.113 --> 00:50:51.805
likes Park Dal I.

00:50:57.905 --> 00:50:59.438
Wait.

00:50:59.438 --> 00:51:03.105
He trusts her enough to share his vulnerabilities.

00:51:03.105 --> 00:51:05.338
And they've even shared chambers.

00:51:05.338 --> 00:51:09.772
Then, why hasn't he made her
a concubine? Just a concubine.

00:51:09.772 --> 00:51:12.505
Could it be because of that?

00:51:12.505 --> 00:51:14.905
- That?
- Nowadays youngsters

00:51:14.905 --> 00:51:16.905
play love's tug-of-war.

00:51:16.905 --> 00:51:19.005
Why suddenly pull the rope?

00:51:19.005 --> 00:51:22.938
Not real ropes, but pulling and pushing emotions.

00:51:22.938 --> 00:51:25.538
It's the tug-of-war of love, pushing away,

00:51:25.538 --> 00:51:29.605
then pulling back when it seems like
you might lose them.

00:51:29.605 --> 00:51:33.105
I said that to survive, to survive.

00:51:33.105 --> 00:51:35.272
With lives at stake, what wouldn't one do?

00:51:35.272 --> 00:51:38.238
Who's to judge?

00:51:38.238 --> 00:51:40.438
Like or dislike, keep it clear!

00:51:40.438 --> 00:51:43.738
What's with being lukewarm?

00:51:43.738 --> 00:51:44.898
Jeez.

00:51:44.898 --> 00:51:47.405
The young people these days

00:51:47.405 --> 00:51:50.805
haven't suffered enough hardships.

00:51:52.805 --> 00:51:55.672
Wait, if I don't take you as a concubine,

00:51:55.672 --> 00:51:58.572
Her Majesty the Grand Queen Dowager might...

00:51:58.572 --> 00:52:00.505
She might even have 'me' killed.

00:52:01.972 --> 00:52:03.638
Ah.

00:52:07.605 --> 00:52:10.305
I should be the one getting comforted.

00:52:10.305 --> 00:52:13.805
From Bissi to the Left Minister and Her Majesty.

00:52:13.805 --> 00:52:15.805
How many mines are there?

00:52:15.805 --> 00:52:18.905
Now, I'm the one who needs to dodge them all.

00:52:22.438 --> 00:52:23.828
Your Highness,

00:52:23.828 --> 00:52:25.305
don't go through

00:52:25.305 --> 00:52:26.305
with this royal marriage.

00:52:26.305 --> 00:52:28.605
Don't worry.

00:52:28.605 --> 00:52:31.605
My body should return before the royal wedding.

00:52:32.738 --> 00:52:35.705
It needs to come back by then anyway.

00:52:37.072 --> 00:52:39.705
Even if we switch back,
cancel this royal marriage.

00:52:42.338 --> 00:52:43.672
What nonsense...

00:52:43.672 --> 00:52:46.538
Marrying a woman who shot you
through the heart makes no sense.

00:52:46.538 --> 00:52:48.972
And endangering my life over this is absurd.

00:52:48.972 --> 00:52:52.905
This whole illogical mess,
so cancel the royal wedding.

00:52:58.305 --> 00:53:01.005
If this marriage is broken,

00:53:01.005 --> 00:53:02.972
the Left Minister will try to kill me.

00:53:02.972 --> 00:53:05.121
They say

00:53:05.121 --> 00:53:08.705
the best defense is offense.

00:53:10.538 --> 00:53:12.938
We must strike before being struck.

00:53:12.938 --> 00:53:16.038
Why are you suddenly staring like that?

00:53:16.038 --> 00:53:19.972
The Gyesa Year incident
and Your Highness' revenge.

00:53:19.972 --> 00:53:21.905
I'll join your vengeance.

00:53:22.972 --> 00:53:25.138
Your Highness' body is currently mine.

00:53:25.138 --> 00:53:29.105
Half of this revenge belongs to me too.

00:53:34.972 --> 00:53:38.438
As you commanded, I investigated Park Dal I.

00:53:38.438 --> 00:53:40.905
The Boryeong Park trading post has closed.

00:53:40.905 --> 00:53:44.038
The Master Leader and his family
have gone into hiding.

00:53:44.038 --> 00:53:45.738
Was this the Crown Prince's order?

00:53:45.738 --> 00:53:47.372
Actually,

00:53:47.372 --> 00:53:50.138
it was arranged by Mr. Heo Ok.

00:53:50.872 --> 00:53:52.105
Why did he do that?

00:53:52.105 --> 00:53:54.241
They say Park Dal I

00:53:54.241 --> 00:53:56.638
is the niece of Mr. Heo Ok's wife.

00:53:57.372 --> 00:53:59.872
After losing both parents
and struggling to survive,

00:53:59.872 --> 00:54:04.272
Mr. Heo made her a porter
at Boryeong trading post.

00:54:18.972 --> 00:54:21.272
What are you doing now?

00:54:22.138 --> 00:54:24.238
Thank you, sir.

00:54:24.238 --> 00:54:28.438
I have to protect this girl
until she grows up, what else can I do?

00:54:28.438 --> 00:54:30.072
I'm leaving.

00:54:40.638 --> 00:54:45.538
There's something I need to verify,
so I'll need your help.

00:54:50.299 --> 00:54:52.513
[Royal Wardrobe]

00:54:55.805 --> 00:54:57.872
I hope you don't go.

00:54:57.872 --> 00:54:59.505
It's too dangerous.

00:55:01.238 --> 00:55:04.572
But we don't even know
when our bodies will return.

00:55:04.572 --> 00:55:07.072
We can't just sit around waiting.

00:55:07.072 --> 00:55:08.272
Still...

00:55:08.272 --> 00:55:12.005
What kind of revenge will be
carried out in the gibang?

00:55:12.005 --> 00:55:15.838
A crown prince mindlessly visiting gibang.

00:55:15.838 --> 00:55:19.272
What better setup to deceive
the Left Minister's eyes?

00:55:19.272 --> 00:55:21.572
This isn't working.

00:55:28.772 --> 00:55:30.945
There's no room for poor looks

00:55:30.945 --> 00:55:33.605
in the scenario I set.

00:55:38.172 --> 00:55:40.172
Stop fidgeting.

00:56:12.872 --> 00:56:14.505
It's done.

00:56:22.538 --> 00:56:24.038
Why?

00:56:24.038 --> 00:56:25.537
What?

00:56:28.672 --> 00:56:30.538
There's a sharp edge at the back.

00:56:35.205 --> 00:56:37.272
Your Highness.

00:56:37.272 --> 00:56:39.305
Your Highness. Your Highness.

00:56:39.305 --> 00:56:41.505
Oh, my. You startled me.

00:56:41.505 --> 00:56:45.438
Why is it always me who sees this?

00:56:45.438 --> 00:56:47.238
This is so annoying.

00:56:47.238 --> 00:56:48.472
It's really annoying.

00:56:48.472 --> 00:56:50.972
Se Dol.

00:56:50.972 --> 00:56:53.072
It's not like that, Se Dol.

00:56:53.072 --> 00:56:54.138
Se Dol.

00:56:54.138 --> 00:56:56.838
Why did that punk have to come in now?

00:56:58.738 --> 00:57:00.138
Your Highness.

00:57:00.138 --> 00:57:01.705
We won't be able to leave today.

00:57:01.705 --> 00:57:02.838
What nonsense is this?

00:57:02.838 --> 00:57:05.305
Prince Je Woon claims to be ill.

00:57:09.072 --> 00:57:10.105
My lord.

00:57:10.105 --> 00:57:13.538
You can't avoid this forever.

00:57:14.238 --> 00:57:17.472
With less than 50 days until the royal wedding,

00:57:17.472 --> 00:57:20.405
wouldn't it be better to wait until then?

00:57:27.272 --> 00:57:29.972
But why is Prince Je Woon seeking revenge?

00:57:29.972 --> 00:57:31.838
He's involved with Bissi, isn't he?

00:57:31.838 --> 00:57:37.072
The Left Minister's false accusations
of the Prince Je Woon's mother

00:57:37.072 --> 00:57:40.305
being involved in the Gyesa Year incident
sparked this whole situation.

00:57:40.305 --> 00:57:42.405
To conceal the Zhen poison scheme.

00:57:42.405 --> 00:57:45.205
That punk messed with his family?

00:57:45.838 --> 00:57:48.372
Oh, our poor Prince Je Woon.

00:57:48.372 --> 00:57:50.938
How distressing this must be.

00:57:50.938 --> 00:57:54.138
Hey, have you ever tried empathizing
with my pain like that?

00:57:54.138 --> 00:57:55.305
Is his pain the only one that counts?

00:57:55.305 --> 00:57:57.705
What about mine?

00:57:58.538 --> 00:58:00.372
I feel your pain every night.

00:58:00.372 --> 00:58:02.105
In your dreams.

00:58:10.972 --> 00:58:12.672
A life where I can stroll

00:58:12.672 --> 00:58:16.438
in flower shoes, carefree.

00:58:24.572 --> 00:58:26.105
Welcome.

00:58:26.105 --> 00:58:27.705
This pair

00:58:28.538 --> 00:58:29.538
and this pair are both lovely.

00:58:29.538 --> 00:58:31.738
This pair and that pair, please.

00:58:45.705 --> 00:58:48.905
You look absolutely beautiful
dressed up like this.

00:58:48.905 --> 00:58:50.505
I admit it.

00:58:51.972 --> 00:58:55.472
What's this supposed to be?

00:58:55.472 --> 00:58:58.505
Well, wearing these proper clothes,

00:58:58.505 --> 00:59:01.272
I look like some noble young mistress.

00:59:01.272 --> 00:59:03.405
Wow, truly beautiful.

00:59:05.605 --> 00:59:07.605
Look straight ahead.

00:59:14.805 --> 00:59:17.038
How beautiful you are.

00:59:17.038 --> 00:59:19.572
How precious you are.

00:59:28.738 --> 00:59:30.238
So, you see?

00:59:30.238 --> 00:59:31.938
Stop saying things like

00:59:31.938 --> 00:59:34.472
you'll become a servant

00:59:34.472 --> 00:59:37.272
or always put others before yourself, alright?

00:59:39.405 --> 00:59:42.272
Oh, my.

00:59:42.272 --> 00:59:43.272
You're so beautiful today.

00:59:43.272 --> 00:59:46.205
You should get your portrait drawn
on a day like this.

00:59:46.205 --> 00:59:48.738
My younger brother paints portraits
just over there.

00:59:48.738 --> 00:59:50.938
[Four cuts of a portrait]
He's exceptionally skilled.

00:59:50.938 --> 00:59:52.638
Since you bought so many clothes today,

00:59:52.638 --> 00:59:54.305
I'll give you

00:59:54.305 --> 00:59:56.705
a special 30% discount.

01:00:00.238 --> 01:00:03.005
Come on, it's not like it's free...

01:00:03.005 --> 01:00:04.905
Forget it, let's just go.

01:00:04.905 --> 01:00:06.338
Let's paint.

01:00:06.338 --> 01:00:09.105
I look pretty today.

01:00:09.105 --> 01:00:11.238
Alright, come on then.

01:00:11.238 --> 01:00:13.605
[Four cuts of a portrait]

01:00:17.272 --> 01:00:19.072
What are you doing?

01:00:19.072 --> 01:00:21.372
Get closer together!

01:00:24.372 --> 01:00:27.938
J-Just start painting.

01:00:27.938 --> 01:00:31.238
The paper's too small,
I'm telling you, it won't work.

01:00:31.238 --> 01:00:33.405
What does the size of the paper
have to do with that?

01:00:33.405 --> 01:00:34.705
Well,

01:00:34.705 --> 01:00:38.572
if the paper's small,

01:00:38.572 --> 01:00:40.238
what can we do?

01:00:40.238 --> 01:00:43.005
Yeah, small paper limits

01:00:43.005 --> 01:00:45.438
the composition, huh?

01:00:48.738 --> 01:00:50.138
Let's begin now.

01:00:50.138 --> 01:00:52.372
It'll be quick.

01:01:02.105 --> 01:01:04.038
Let's move on to the second pose.

01:01:09.505 --> 01:01:13.405
Goodness, you two look so stiff.

01:01:13.405 --> 01:01:15.472
Here we go.

01:01:15.472 --> 01:01:17.238
Hold that position.

01:01:21.105 --> 01:01:24.038
For the third one, young lady,
smile brightly like this.

01:01:24.038 --> 01:01:26.672
M‑me? I don't usually get nervous, but...

01:01:26.672 --> 01:01:27.872
Understood.

01:01:27.872 --> 01:01:30.272
It's me, me.

01:01:30.272 --> 01:01:31.605
What nonsense is this?

01:01:31.605 --> 01:01:33.705
Come on, give me a big smile.

01:01:33.705 --> 01:01:36.838
My, how lovely.

01:01:36.838 --> 01:01:39.772
The young mistress glows when smiling.

01:01:40.572 --> 01:01:43.972
And for the last one. Both of you,
smile as wide as you can.

01:01:54.172 --> 01:01:56.272
Oh, gorgeous.

01:01:56.272 --> 01:01:59.738
Captured you perfectly.

01:02:01.345 --> 01:02:03.425
Oh, so wonderful!

01:02:07.605 --> 01:02:10.572
Even your nostrils feel divine.

01:02:10.572 --> 01:02:11.572
Don't make a fuss.

01:02:11.572 --> 01:02:14.472
Take a sniff and see.
Is it just fuss, or is it real?

01:02:28.238 --> 01:02:29.838
It's not just fuss.

01:02:29.838 --> 01:02:33.305
Y-Yeah.

01:02:35.805 --> 01:02:39.905
What a wonderful fragrance.

01:02:39.905 --> 01:02:44.305
That fragrance could kill a man.

01:02:44.305 --> 01:02:46.472
You're not selling something dangerous, are you?

01:02:46.472 --> 01:02:48.838
Of course not, never.

01:02:48.838 --> 01:02:51.538
It's just an occupational hazard for perfumers.

01:02:51.538 --> 01:02:54.505
Daily exposure to strong scents and smoke

01:02:54.505 --> 01:02:57.405
ruins the lungs.

01:02:58.072 --> 01:03:02.472
Why keep doing this if it destroys you?

01:03:02.472 --> 01:03:04.272
Financial hardship?

01:03:04.272 --> 01:03:08.705
Who'd choke their livelihood for mere survival?

01:03:08.705 --> 01:03:10.905
We guard what we love.

01:03:10.905 --> 01:03:14.372
My old woman loves the incense,
so she keeps her place.

01:03:14.372 --> 01:03:18.605
I love her, so I stay by her side.

01:03:19.438 --> 01:03:23.038
It's been forty years like that.

01:03:23.038 --> 01:03:26.805
A husband should protect his bride's dream.
What happens if he doesn't?

01:03:26.805 --> 01:03:28.905
I protect what's dear.

01:03:28.905 --> 01:03:31.572
What else can I do?

01:03:40.305 --> 01:03:42.338
Wow.

01:03:46.072 --> 01:03:49.072
What's this?

01:03:49.072 --> 01:03:50.638
How pretty.

01:03:50.638 --> 01:03:52.905
Look at this.

01:04:12.738 --> 01:04:15.972
Fallen on the dirty ground...

01:04:15.972 --> 01:04:17.538
Dirty? Nonsense!

01:04:17.538 --> 01:04:18.672
It's perfectly lovely.

01:04:18.672 --> 01:04:20.605
Lovely?

01:04:20.605 --> 01:04:22.472
They say spring melts away the snow,

01:04:22.472 --> 01:04:24.105
but it's people

01:04:26.338 --> 01:04:28.238
who sweep up the petals.

01:04:28.238 --> 01:04:30.938
This takes money and labor.

01:04:31.938 --> 01:04:33.505
Why bother?

01:04:33.505 --> 01:04:37.072
The soft pile of petals feels nice somehow.

01:04:37.705 --> 01:04:40.238
The petals are the ones piling up,
but why are you feeling good?

01:04:40.238 --> 01:04:42.105
They say dust gathers into a mountain,

01:04:42.105 --> 01:04:44.605
and petals gathered bring happiness.

01:04:44.605 --> 01:04:46.305
Doesn't 'piling up'

01:04:46.305 --> 01:04:50.405
sound like small blessings piling up

01:04:50.405 --> 01:04:53.372
until happiness is inevitable?

01:05:15.272 --> 01:05:16.905
My lord!

01:05:45.005 --> 01:05:48.538
They say this scent helps you sleep.

01:05:48.538 --> 01:05:50.605
I just wanted to thank you.

01:06:08.705 --> 01:06:11.038
You go back to the palace first.

01:06:54.672 --> 01:06:56.138
What were you doing?

01:06:56.138 --> 01:06:59.238
I was listening to the sound of snow falling.

01:06:59.238 --> 01:07:04.405
Don't you think those little blessings,
piling up like snow,

01:07:04.405 --> 01:07:07.505
will surely bring happiness someday?

01:07:12.638 --> 01:07:14.705
Give me your hand.

01:07:26.805 --> 01:07:28.505
Here.

01:07:28.505 --> 01:07:30.905
This is today's little blessing.

01:07:40.305 --> 01:07:42.672
It's truly beautiful.

01:07:44.505 --> 01:07:46.338
I mean it.

01:07:52.672 --> 01:07:55.772
I smiled while looking at another woman.

01:07:56.672 --> 01:07:58.938
I dared to feel joy.

01:07:59.905 --> 01:08:02.072
Shamelessly.

01:08:07.105 --> 01:08:10.005
Can you forgive me, because

01:08:13.205 --> 01:08:15.338
she resembles you so much?

01:08:15.338 --> 01:08:23.472
♫ I sketch your face though it won't take shape ♫

01:08:40.005 --> 01:08:41.872
What is this...

01:08:43.072 --> 01:08:44.638
Why are you doing this?

01:08:44.638 --> 01:08:47.638
Untie me.

01:08:47.638 --> 01:08:49.438
Don't waste your strength.

01:08:49.438 --> 01:08:52.238
The drug's effect still lingers.

01:08:52.238 --> 01:08:54.105
Is it the Left Minister?

01:08:55.572 --> 01:08:57.705
Did he order you to kill me?

01:08:57.705 --> 01:08:59.805
I'd almost prefer it that way myself.

01:08:59.805 --> 01:09:01.405
But since he said he has something to confirm,

01:09:01.405 --> 01:09:04.938
I'll only leave a mark, nothing fatal.

01:09:07.072 --> 01:09:08.505
Infertility medicine.

01:09:08.505 --> 01:09:11.638
Bearing the royal heir is your only worth.

01:09:11.638 --> 01:09:13.072
Once you lose that,

01:09:13.072 --> 01:09:16.572
the Grand Queen Dowager
will have you killed first.

01:09:19.072 --> 01:09:21.305
Don't. Let me go.

01:09:21.305 --> 01:09:22.938
Let go of me.

01:09:22.938 --> 01:09:24.738
Stop. Let go of me!

01:09:24.738 --> 01:09:26.372
Let go of me!

01:09:33.372 --> 01:09:35.805
Who do you think you are, wearing flower shoes?

01:09:35.805 --> 01:09:37.472
Burn them.

01:09:44.538 --> 01:09:46.593
It's too big

01:09:46.593 --> 01:09:48.672
to call it a mere dream.

01:09:49.605 --> 01:09:52.038
but beyond straw sandals,

01:09:52.038 --> 01:09:53.938
a life wearing flower shoes.

01:09:53.938 --> 01:09:58.572
A life where I stop running and finally build

01:09:58.572 --> 01:10:01.238
a real family of my own.

01:10:06.472 --> 01:10:08.072
How dare...

01:10:12.172 --> 01:10:13.772
How dare you!

01:10:23.238 --> 01:10:24.505
What are you doing?

01:10:24.505 --> 01:10:26.438
Seize that wench again.

01:10:37.438 --> 01:10:39.172
You wench!

01:10:47.538 --> 01:10:49.138
That wench...

01:11:02.605 --> 01:11:05.005
That... that vicious wench!

01:11:05.005 --> 01:11:09.005
Burning your bare hands
in the brazier over a pair of shoes...

01:11:36.205 --> 01:11:38.038
Not here.

01:11:39.605 --> 01:11:41.505
If you must collapse,

01:11:43.305 --> 01:11:45.705
do it somewhere safe.

01:11:56.638 --> 01:12:00.338
Even street con men don't mess
with people's minds like this.

01:12:00.338 --> 01:12:02.038
One moment you're a warm spring breeze,

01:12:02.038 --> 01:12:04.638
and the next you turn into an icy wind.

01:12:04.638 --> 01:12:06.672
Of course, I would feel wronged, right?

01:12:06.672 --> 01:12:08.705
Are you tired of me too?

01:12:08.705 --> 01:12:10.505
Now you turn your back on me too?

01:12:10.505 --> 01:12:13.372
Where are you going? I haven't finished speaking.

01:12:13.372 --> 01:12:16.272
Mang Deok.

01:12:16.272 --> 01:12:18.272
Mang Deok.

01:12:18.272 --> 01:12:20.038
Mang Deok.

01:12:22.705 --> 01:12:24.738
Mang Deok.

01:12:24.738 --> 01:12:26.372
Mang Deok.

01:12:27.705 --> 01:12:30.005
Where are you going?

01:12:37.705 --> 01:12:38.905
Mang Deok!

01:12:38.905 --> 01:12:40.505
Good heavens, you startled me!

01:12:44.005 --> 01:12:45.638
Your Highness?

01:12:48.905 --> 01:12:50.505
Your Highness!

01:12:51.205 --> 01:12:53.938
What on earth happened?

01:12:53.938 --> 01:12:56.385
Why aren't you wearing the shoes?

01:12:56.385 --> 01:12:58.738
And you're holding them like a treasure?

01:13:01.105 --> 01:13:03.538
Walking barefoot?

01:13:03.538 --> 01:13:05.738
What on earth...

01:13:05.738 --> 01:13:08.605
Why are your hands like this?

01:13:14.938 --> 01:13:17.872
You said wearing flower shoes
was your dream, right?

01:13:17.872 --> 01:13:20.805
Now you're obsessed with them again?

01:13:22.172 --> 01:13:26.038
A husband should protect his bride's dream.
What happens if he doesn't?

01:13:26.038 --> 01:13:27.838
I protect what's dear.

01:13:27.838 --> 01:13:30.505
What else can I do?

01:13:31.238 --> 01:13:32.918
You

01:13:33.665 --> 01:13:35.638
wear the flower shoes.

01:13:36.972 --> 01:13:39.329
I'll be the one

01:13:39.329 --> 01:13:41.338
running barefoot.

01:13:43.238 --> 01:13:45.205
What nonsense...

01:13:49.105 --> 01:13:50.705
Now,

01:13:53.372 --> 01:13:55.872
I can't pretend anymore.

01:14:09.872 --> 01:14:11.738
Your Highness.

01:14:11.738 --> 01:14:14.805
Your Highness.

01:14:19.172 --> 01:14:21.172
Your Highness.

01:14:23.205 --> 01:14:26.238
Right now, this girl is in my body,

01:14:28.705 --> 01:14:30.705
and the moon flows

01:14:33.005 --> 01:14:35.038
in my heart.

01:15:01.905 --> 01:15:05.272
Oh, no. Please, get a hold of yourself!

01:15:05.272 --> 01:15:06.938
So, this is why our bodies were switched.

01:15:06.938 --> 01:15:08.372
I could be the one hurt instead of you.

01:15:08.372 --> 01:15:12.605
That face resembling
the deposed Crown Princess irritates me.

01:15:12.605 --> 01:15:13.705
Get rid of her.

01:15:13.705 --> 01:15:16.705
You can't protect Dal I.

01:15:16.705 --> 01:15:19.538
From now on, I'm your shield.

01:15:19.538 --> 01:15:21.072
Hide behind me.

01:15:21.072 --> 01:15:25.338
When Your Highness keeps acting like this,
it makes me hope for impossible things.

01:15:25.338 --> 01:15:27.505
Your Highness, do you like me?